    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "At Glenville Garden, the three-bedroom, two-bathroom apartments are designed to offer exceptional space, comfort and quality in a prestigious Mount Merrion setting. Ranging in size from approximately 94 sq.m to 187 sq.m, these stunning homes provide generously proportioned interiors with bright, open-plan layouts that maximise natural light and enhance everyday living. Each apartment features three well-sized bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, a high-quality kitchen and living area, and two sleek, modern bathrooms, all finished to an exceptional standard throughout. Private balconies or terraces extend the living space outdoors, ideal for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying the landscaped surroundings. These energy-efficient residences deliver refined apartment living on Fosters Avenue."
      },
